Description: Estimates site-level RNA mutation or conversion signal from
    matched treatment and control read-count tables. MIRAGE supports
    motif-specific inference with sequence-context priors and motif-free
    empirical inference for mutation-induction or conversion-based RNA
    assays.
URL: https://github.com/yangli04/MIRAGE, https://yangli04.github.io/MIRAGE/
BugReports: https://github.com/yangli04/MIRAGE/issues
